# Admin credentials used by the /login page.
#
# The default credentials live in `src/data/auth.json` (committed to the repo,
# password stored as a SHA-256 hash) and can be changed online from the
# /admin/password page after signing in.
#
# These build-time variables OVERRIDE the bundled defaults at build time:
#
#   VITE_ADMIN_EMAIL          - Override the admin email.
#   VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD       - Override the admin password (plain text;
#                               hashed in-memory at runtime).
#   VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH  - Override the admin password directly with
#                               a 64-char hex SHA-256 digest (preferred for
#                               CI / Pages secrets so the plain text never
#                               enters the build environment).
#
VITE_ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@portfolio.com
# VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD=Admin@2024
# VITE_ADMIN_PASSWORD_HASH=d3fc50c8f714cebd16d6c827826df01205bf519529f9d34775293cf9b70a420e

# Base path for the built assets.
# Use "/" for a generic React deploy at the site root (Netlify, Vercel, S3, …)
# or "/<repo-name>/" for GitHub Pages under a project subpath.
VITE_BASE_PATH=/
